    <briefdescription>
<para>Runtime GPU/CPU backend selection with device detection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides GeoBackendDispatcher for seamless GPU/CPU dispatch selection. Supports compile-time feature gating (THEMIS_GEO_CUDA) and runtime GPU device detection with graceful CPU fallback.</para>
<para>Performance targets (Gates A-06-01/02):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Haversine batch distance: p95/p99 ≤ 500ms (GPU), ≤ 50ms (CPU baseline)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Point-in-polygon batch: p95/p99 ≤ 2ms (GPU), ≤ 0.5ms (CPU baseline) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
